  "summary": "Plays a tune of patterns with interrupts off: an order table of pattern pointers, a pattern byte $C0+n sets the note length, $FF ends the pattern, any other byte is a note number into a period table; each note runs two counters of period p and p+1 passes that flip the speaker (OUT $FE bit 4), so the two voices beat. Fire (the game's check) or the keys 1-5 end it.",
